ubkey":null},{"content_hash":"4d5bdf2459145974761f5c720a63889bb5479760ed1788c6e5c6d1b94f863a89","event_uuid":"9bfe56bb-69cb-4f24-b231-356b7bf04a13","position":{"commit_sha":"4be04e6748f9126532d6202ea03d6cf9371f5417","position":"1789902934873186159-9bfe56bb-69cb-4f24-b231-356b7bf04a13"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"close_class":"plan_defect","comments":[{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"## Root cause (investigated, not yet fixed)\n\n`.github/workflows/verify-identity.yml:36-39` checks out with `filter: blob:none` and\n`fetch-depth: 0` but **no `ref:`**. `actions/checkout` therefore fetches *all branch heads* —\nincluding the `tickets` branch — before the pack budget is measured at lines 41-58 and judged at\nlines 114-116. The budget is judging an all-refs object database, not a main-only code checkout.\n\nRun 35480996877's log confirms the fetch shape:\n`git fetch --no-tags --prune --no-recurse-submodules --filter=blob:none origin\n+refs/heads/*:refs/remotes/origin/* +refs/tags/*:refs/tags/*`.\n\n### Measured reproduction\n\nScratch clones against the same remote, same `--filter=blob:none`:\n\n| checkout shape | `git count-objects -vH` |\n|---|---:|\n| main-only blobless fetch, checkout `origin/main` | `size-pack: 22.84 MiB`, in-pack 30519 |\n| all-heads blobless fetch, checkout `origin/main` | `size-pack: 633.02 MiB`, in-pack 820686 |\n| the failing CI run | `648484 KiB` = ~633.29 MiB |\n\nThe all-heads shape reproduces CI to within ~0.27 MiB. That is the root cause, confirmed\nempirically rather than inferred.\n\nA single large blob is ruled out as the direct cause: this pack is *blobless*. `origin/tickets`\nreachable under `--filter=blob:none` is dominated by non-blob history — 496160 tree objects and\n293827 commits, zero blobs. The volume is tickets-branch tree/commit history pulled in because\n`tickets` was fetched as part of all heads.\n\n### Why the previous fix did not prevent this\n\n`e900fa14ad5` (\"Stop pack budget pre-empting authorship gate\") only split the gate into a\nmeasure half and a judge half so the budget verdict stops pre-empting the authorship verdict. It\ndeliberately left the limit, the checkout shape, and the fail-closed behaviour unchanged, so it\ncannot reduce the measured pack.\n\n### The in-repo working example\n\nOther workflows that need full history already scope the checkout to main:\n`reconcile-bridge-canary.yml:88-98` and `dependency-advisory-canary.yml:64-72` both set\n`filter: blob:none`, `fetch-depth: 0` **and `ref: main`**. `verify-identity.yml` is the outlier.\n\n### Proposed fix — narrow the checkout, do NOT raise the budget\n\nAdd `ref: main` to the initial `actions/checkout`. The later explicit\n`git fetch origin '+tickets:refs/remotes/origin/tickets'` still mounts the tickets store for\nidentity verification, and it runs *after* the measurement.\n\nThis is the right shape of fix: the 563200 KiB limit is already a temporary bridge (the deliberate\nbudget is 102400 KiB per `fluorspar-comparable-zeren`, raised while 536b history reclaim lands),\nand ADR 0106 establishes the budget as an intentional growth canary. Raising it again would\nsilence the canary; narrowing the checkout removes the reason to.\n\nAdds no new gate, env var, config key, feature flag, lock, fixture or helper, so it should not\ntrip the mechanism-delta, module-size, or complexity ratchets.","timestamp":1789884778846908276},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","body":"Completion evidence for merged fix:\n\n- Gerrit change 3001, revision `0999781728f41ea059d40f42f064d6f8c69edb8d`, earned `LLM-Review +1` and `Verified +1`; submit returned MERGED.\n- Merged commit: `cc4a23a2405b752a0d9587720f9295ec72871372` (`Fix verify-identity checkout pack measurement`).\n- Live `Verify Authorship Identity` workflow run `35505599913` completed with conclusion `success` on `cc4a23a2405b752a0d9587720f9295ec72871372`; job `verify-identity (authenticated-authorship gate)` succeeded, including `Fetch full code ref history`, `Measure the blobless checkout pack`, `verify-identity (gating)`, `verify-opcert (required-environment op-cert gate)`, and `Fail closed if the blobless checkout pack exceeds its limit`.\n- Local pre-push `make verify` on this exact change produced `17 failed, 20238 passed, 126 skipped in 1499.00s`; all 17 failures were the known macOS arm64 host packaging defect where `pypandoc-binary==1.17` ships an x86_64 `pandoc` (`Bad CPU type in executable`). CI's Linux gating cell is unaffected and voted `Verified +1`.\n- Targeted merged-revision pytest command, run from a `git archive` extraction with `PYTHONPATH` pinned to that extracted tree, completed: `13 passed in 1.83s`.\n","timestamp":1789901966691106001},{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","body":"Supplemental completion evidence for the live workflow run log:\n\n- `Verify Authorship Identity` run `35505599913` on head SHA `cc4a23a2405b752a0d9587720f9295ec72871372` completed with conclusion `success`.\n- The run log for the `Fail closed if the blobless checkout pack exceeds its limit` step reported `SIZE_PACK_KIB: 23460`, confirming the code-only blobless checkout is approximately the predicted 23 MiB and below the restored `102400` KiB budget.\n","timestamp":1789902291483545001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1789882875313769252,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"dc82162a-d37d-429b-9521-5bf2ac846526","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"b2dc-b1ab-0bd9-47f6"},{"link_uuid":"fbd77ca5-99ec-4af2-94a1-1ec5bacc07c8","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"945c-f66b-8ffd-4d93"},{"link_uuid":"841fc2cc-a546-4e5c-96a3-7d704701a74f","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"0ddb-51a5-001d-47e8"}],"description":"GitHub Actions periodic ops sweep window 2026-09-02T17:00:00Z..2026-09-20T05:05:00Z found the latest main run of `Verify Authorship Identity` failing on main.\n\nEvidence:\n- Workflow: Verify Authorship Identity\n- Run: https://github.com/navapbc/rebar/actions/runs/35480996877\n- Run id: 35480996877\n- Event: schedule\n- Head branch/SHA: main @ 8f7417079ade1132038a6e0dd24216e8c71aa706\n- Failed job: `verify-identity (authenticated-authorship gate)`, job id 105998656229\n- Failed step: `Fail closed if the blobless checkout pack exceeds its limit`\n- Exact error: `checkout pack is 648484 KiB; limit is 563200 KiB`\n- Prior same-signature runs in the sweep include 34744072235, 34758403263, 34776110490, 34795450685, 34816527512, 34846325925, 34883745947, 34916409419, 34939623644, 34971940954, 35010479904, 35043192700, 35066474083, 35098926763, 35137380383, 35169701340, 35192575898, 35224107600, 35261857270, 35294424021, 35317397061, 35347332156, 35382979238, 35410257116, 35411796798, 35427969656, 35444245473, 35462717190, 35480996877.\n\nThis affects main's operational CI signal: the latest scheduled identity-authorship verification for main is red before the identity checks can complete.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] The latest `Verify Authorship Identity` run on `main` completes successfully, or the pack-size budget/check is updated so a healthy blobless checkout no longer fails at `648xxx KiB` against the stale `563200 KiB` threshold. [non-codebase] Run 35505599913 completed with conclusion `success` on head SHA `cc4a23a2405b752a0d9587720f9295ec72871372`; log reported `SIZE_PACK_KIB: 23460` against the restored `102400` KiB budget.\n- [x] The workflow still fails closed when the checkout pack is genuinely abnormal or the pack measurement cannot be produced.\n- [x] The remediation documents the expected steady-state pack size or source of the budget so future growth is intentional rather than silently widening the gate.\n\n## Verification\n\nRun or inspect a fresh `Verify Authorship Identity` workflow on `main` and confirm the `verify-identity (authenticated-authorship gate)` job reaches success without bypassing the pack-size check.\n","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","managed_refs":[["relates_to","0ddb-51a5-001d-47e8"],["relates_to","945c-f66b-8ffd-4d93"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"5bf15d56-8ab5-4d76-8a2a-44ea82737449","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"bc25-1351-dd0e-4909","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Verify Authorship Identity is red on main because the blobless checkout exceeds the pack-size budget","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["e86c41b7-6b15-4ccf-bce0-92f839afa06a","6f33715a-d208-4eda-803d-afe65c11565b","e5f14225-91c4-4a0c-b717-036b0dad47c7","6310cd4e-6645-4e41-a524-0e33e15433dd","fbd77ca5-99ec-4af2-94a1-1ec5bacc07c8","841fc2cc-a546-4e5c-96a3-7d704701a74f","9dd910b7-cee9-4d33-9eb4-904608ec7f9d","9b4c397e-c0d3-4879-acc9-d89326d3bbeb","0821a632-62d9-4419-bfb2-443335d20e03","fc853a71-5be2-400e-82f6-4642be92ea02","5bf15d56-8ab5-4d76-8a2a-44ea82737449","9bfe56bb-69cb-4f24-b231-356b7bf04a13"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1789906753243524798,"uuid":"b4f89df6-3b43-4f85-a4e7-d3e23b650079"}